-- importprom: the §13.25 module fixture (import-position promotion).
-- The module imports inner with BOTH bytestring positions promoted:
-- its "..." literals desugar at parse time to bytesBind AutoN +
-- import — the Auto atoms are ordinary source atoms and mangle with
-- the module's suffix (Auto0_v2, …), so the promoted binds and the
-- import's references to them stay consistent within the module, and
-- two modules promoting the same literal cannot collide. Shape of
-- outer.lind (which does the same load with an explicit handle).
: import "inner" "" []

(Go, reply) : lob reply (InnerHi,)
